{"id":3435,"date":"2026-03-28T23:00:00","date_gmt":"2026-03-28T23:00:00","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/cde-me.com\/?p=3435"},"modified":"2026-03-29T20:06:10","modified_gmt":"2026-03-29T20:06:10","slug":"condition-assessment","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/cde-me.com\/condition-assessment\/","title":{"rendered":"Condition Assessment"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Introduction<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Understanding the true condition of a structure is the foundation of any successful engineering intervention. Over time, structures are exposed to environmental effects, material degradation, and usage-related stresses that may not always be visible on the surface.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">A professional condition assessment provides clarity\u2014helping stakeholders make informed decisions regarding repair, strengthening, or continued service.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">What is Condition Assessment?<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Condition assessment is a systematic evaluation of a structure to determine its current state, identify defects, and understand the underlying causes of deterioration.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">At CDE, we go beyond visual inspection. Our approach combines engineering expertise, testing methodologies, and analytical tools to provide a complete understanding of structural performance.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Our Approach<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">1. Visual Inspection<\/h4>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">We conduct detailed on-site inspections to identify visible defects such as cracks, spalling, corrosion signs, and surface deterioration.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">2. Review of Documents<\/h4>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Existing drawings, specifications, and construction records are analyzed to understand design intent and historical performance.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">3. Testing &amp; Investigation<\/h4>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">We employ non-destructive and, where necessary, destructive testing methods to evaluate material properties and structural integrity.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">4. Defect Mapping<\/h4>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">All observations are systematically recorded and mapped to identify patterns and severity.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">5. Root Cause Analysis<\/h4>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Identifying the cause of deterioration is critical. We analyze environmental exposure, construction quality, and material behavior to determine why defects occurred.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Scope of Services<\/h2>\n\n\n<style>.wp-block-kadence-iconlist.kt-svg-icon-list-items3435_c27b78-9e:not(.this-stops-third-party-issues){margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;}.wp-block-kadence-iconlist.kt-svg-icon-list-items3435_c27b78-9e ul.kt-svg-icon-list:not(.this-prevents-issues):not(.this-stops-third-party-issues):not(.tijsloc){margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:var(--global-kb-spacing-sm, 1.5rem);margin-left:0px;}.wp-block-kadence-iconlist.kt-svg-icon-list-items3435_c27b78-9e ul.kt-svg-icon-list{grid-row-gap:5px;}.wp-block-kadence-iconlist.kt-svg-icon-list-items3435_c27b78-9e ul.kt-svg-icon-list .kt-svg-icon-list-item-wrap .kt-svg-icon-list-single{margin-right:10px;}.kt-svg-icon-list-items3435_c27b78-9e ul.kt-svg-icon-list .kt-svg-icon-list-level-0 .kt-svg-icon-list-single svg{font-size:20px;}<\/style>\n<div class=\"wp-block-kadence-iconlist kt-svg-icon-list-items kt-svg-icon-list-items3435_c27b78-9e kt-svg-icon-list-columns-1 alignnone\"><ul class=\"kt-svg-icon-list\"><style>.kt-svg-icon-list-item-3435_a2107f-58 .kt-svg-icon-list-text mark.kt-highlight{background-color:unset;font-style:normal;color:#f76a0c;-webkit-box-decoration-break:clone;box-decoration-break:clone;padding-top:0px;padding-ri